1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Only one of these is a polynomial.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,600
Which one?

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,800
A monomial is a number times a power of x…

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:12,233
…where the exponent k is a whole number.

5
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:16,367
A polynomial is a sum of monomials.

6
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:20,967
Scan the exponents: 2, 1, and 0. All whole numbers.

7
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:21,967
Polynomial.

8
00:00:21,967 --> 00:00:28,767
√x is x¹/², and ½ isn't a whole number.

9
00:00:28,767 --> 00:00:33,267
Dividing by a variable is not allowed either.

10
00:00:33,267 --> 00:00:40,300
Name it by counting terms: one, two, or three…

11
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,900
A polynomial: a sum of terms,

12
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:47,467
each with a whole-number exponent.
